# Non-secret additions for the existing v2 deployment configuration.
# v2 now shares Settings.build_commit, including the RENDER_GIT_COMMIT fallback.
# On non-Render hosts set BUILD_COMMIT to the actual full SHA of the deployed code.
# Do not set a fabricated SHA merely to turn the evidence page green.
